<h2>TMA for the session 2026-27</h2>

<p><a
href="/media/documents/notification/yr2022/admission_TMA_2022/TMA_online_7Jan2022.pdf"
 target="_blank" title="pdf">Notification 01/2022 dt. 07 Jan, 2022
regarding Provision for downloading/uploading TMAs (Secondary/
Sr.Secondary) from the student portal of NIOS
(https://sdmis.nios.ac.in)</a>&nbsp;<img src="/images/pdf_icon.gif" alt="PDF File"/>&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src="/media/93420/newgood.gif" width="33" height="16" alt="Newgood"/></p>

