August&nbsp;</li>
</ul>

<h3>Secondary Assignments - 2026-27</h3>

<ul>
<li><a href="/media/documents/TMA-2026-27/10th/AllSec25-26.pdf"
target="_blank">TMA Secondary Download-All
Subjects-2025-26</a></li>

